@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@couponId = 1
@categoryId = 2

### List coupon-category associations
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories

### Filter associations by coupon
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories?couponId={{couponId}}

### Get association by composite key
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories/{{couponId}}/{{categoryId}}

### Associate category with coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponId": 1,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Update association
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories/{{couponId}}/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Remove association
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coupon-categories/{{couponId}}/{{categoryId}}
